(
    title: "Crossbow",
    description: Some("Exidy\'s gallery shooter brought home: your unarmed friends walk each Danger Zone on their own, and the joystick-steered crossbow sight is their only shield against scorpions, swooping bats, coconut-hurling monkeys and the castle\'s archers, all the way to the dragon-guarded treasure. You choose each leg on the Paths screen, the harder levels make the sight invisible until you fire, and the Evil Master\'s watching eye pays a thousand points on every screen."),
